{"title":"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A finite <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a281826fab0dc40a4eb1bbf99c6f1c19afbe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> of distinct real numbers has the following properties: the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_mean\" title=\"Arithmetic mean\">mean</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac1e364cfa89cdaeae35bc55588f56a4662e10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}\\cup\\{1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> less than the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a281826fab0dc40a4eb1bbf99c6f1c19afbe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/f/95fafc21a1a4ab24b0548891209ac2ed81b7872c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}\\cup\\{2001\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> more than the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a281826fab0dc40a4eb1bbf99c6f1c19afbe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. Find the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a281826fab0dc40a4eb1bbf99c6f1c19afbe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a281826fab0dc40a4eb1bbf99c6f1c19afbe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of elements in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a281826fab0dc40a4eb1bbf99c6f1c19afbe0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{S}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\nThen, the given tells us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2313a9e76e2d367918739ef3c8740282ac84f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ax+1}{a+1}=x-13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17be0a9d8ef80a982bdc1b4a3dd17e0d5dd02616.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ax+2001}{a+1}=x+27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"157\" height=\"39\" />. Subtracting, we have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06b06b677c658106c3ceb375c4b67e034d2a9111.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\frac{ax+2001}{a+1}-40=\\frac{ax+1}{a+1} \\Longrightarrow \\frac{2000}{a+1}=40 \\Longrightarrow a=49\\end{align*}\" width=\"418\" height=\"39\" />\nWe plug that into our very first formula, and get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/8/278ffebf2cdc5ce292396349c56c2498ca0f5c56.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\frac{49x+1}{50}&amp;=x-13 \\\\ 49x+1&amp;=50x-650 \\\\ x&amp;=\\boxed{651}.\\end{align*}\" width=\"163\" height=\"93\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since this is a weighted average problem, the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/a/aea1a654fdc85740c5be7a3c2ce4f2ac660d2f34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{13}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> as far from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as it is from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7e2da81334aad3aeeb09706fed72248196613b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2001$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, the mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/0/63084ebb92fbdd6ee4977440c6b5dacc69d79a22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac{13}{13 + 27}(2001 - 1) = \\boxed{651}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"239\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IziHKOubUI8?t=27\">https://youtu.be/IziHKOubUI8?t=27</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I\" title=\"2001 AIME I\">2001 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2001 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external